# Code of conduct

Violation can mean immediate dismissal from Riga and future Snorkel work.

- Spam: short, repetitive, templated, high-volume low-value items
- Plagiarism: contests, papers, other experts, lightly reworded internal items
- Repeated rejections after coaching
- Low AHT: completion times that say thinking was skipped
- Hostile, recruiting, or unprofessional talk

Work slowly. Write original science. Be civil in `#ec-riga-reviews`. Do not manufacture volume by cloning yesterday's draft.
